          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ abahungu biwe bāhora barondera amazimano mu nzu y’ umuntu wese muri bo ku musi ashinze, bagatumira bashiki babo ukw ari batatu ngo baze gusangira na bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.16.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 16:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 2:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.42.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "42:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ ukw imisi y’amazimano yabo yahera, Yobu yabatumako ngw abeze, akavyuka kare mu gatondo, agatanga ibimazi vyoswa bihwanye n’igitigiri ca bose: kuko Yobu yavuga, ati Kumbure abahungu banje bācumuye, barogota ku Mana mu mitima yabo. Uko ni ko Yobu yahora agenza ubudasiba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
